<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CPC estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CPC estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- BT Securities analyst John O'Neil said he raised his 1996 earnings estimate for CPC International Inc, a food company, to $4.00 a share from $3.98.</p>
<p>-- He also raised his estimate for 1997 to $4.55 a share from $4.50.</p>
<p>-- Higher estimates for CPC reflect lower corn costs, O'Neil said.</p>
<p>-- CPC shares rose 1/8 at 75-1/8.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
